      "text": "```\nMechanism: form covalent adducts with DNA nucleophiles (N7-guanine most common)\n  → Intrastrand cross-links → blocks replication/transcription\n  → Interstrand cross-links → DNA double strand breaks\n  → Phase-nonspecific (kill in any cell cycle phase)"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-CANCER-DRUGS.md#011",
      "path": [
